
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Responsive CSS Grid photo gallery by Abdul Suboor Khan.">
  <meta name="author" content="Abdul Suboor Khan">
  <title>CSS Grid Photo Gallery | Abdul Suboor Khan</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --background: #10131c;
      --surface: #1b2130;
      --accent: #71e0d0;
      --text: #f5f7ff;
      --muted: #b7c0d3;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 2rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    header {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    header h1 span {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    header p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    .student-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--accent);
      border: 1px solid #71e0d055;
      background: #71e0d010;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      grid-auto-rows: 190px;
      gap: 12px;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .gallery figure {
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 12px;
      position: relative;
      background: var(--surface);
      isolation: isolate;
    }

    .gallery img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }

    .gallery figure:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.07);
    }

    .gallery figure:focus-within {
      outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .gallery figcaption {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      padding: 1.5rem 0.8rem 0.7rem;
      background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85));
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: white;
    }

    .wide {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }

    .tall {
      grid-row: span 2;
    }

    .big {
      grid-column: span 2;
      grid-row: span 2;
    }

    .gallery-info {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    footer {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 2.5rem auto 0;
      padding-top: 1.2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid #ffffff20;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      body {
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }

      .gallery {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        grid-auto-rows: 180px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      body {
        padding: 1rem;
      }

      .gallery {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        grid-auto-rows: 230px;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .wide,
      .big {
        grid-column: auto;
      }

      .tall,
      .big {
        grid-row: span 1;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html {
        scroll-behavior: auto;
      }

      .gallery img {
        transition: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>My <span>Photo Gallery</span></h1>
    <p>A collection of beautiful landscapes arranged with CSS Grid.</p>
    <div class="student-tag">
      Abdul Suboor Khan | First-Year BCA Student
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="gallery" aria-label="Landscape photo gallery">

      <figure class="big">
        <img
          src="https://picsum.photos/id/1015/800/800"
          alt="River winding through a green mountain valley"
          loading="eager">
        <figcaption>River Valley</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure>
        <img
          src="https://picsum.photos/id/1016/400/400"
          alt="Rocky canyon landscape"
          loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>Canyon</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="tall">
        <img
          src="https://picsum.photos/id/1018/400/800"
          alt="Mountain peak surrounded by mist"
          loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>Misty Peak</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure>
        <img
          src="https://picsum.photos/id/1019/400/400"
          alt="Wooden jetty extending over a calm lake"
          loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>Lake Jetty</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="wide">
        <img
          src="https://picsum.photos/id/1036/800/400"
          alt="Snow-covered trees in a winter forest"
          loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>Winter Forest</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure>
        <img
          src="https://picsum.photos/id/1039/400/400"
          alt="Waterfall flowing through a green landscape"
          loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>Waterfall</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure>
        <img
          src="https://picsum.photos/id/1043/400/400"
          alt="Open field beneath an evening sky"
          loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>Evening Sky</figcaption>
      </figure>

    </section>

    <p class="gallery-info">
      Built with CSS Grid, responsive layouts, image cropping,
      and hover transitions.
    </p>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Abdul Suboor Khan | BCA HTML & CSS Assignment</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
